<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <meta name="viewport"
          content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <meta name="description"
          content="A simple high-performance HTTP server built in C">

    <title>C Server — Simple. Fast. Powerful.</title>

